### LibrariAI Mobile API — HTTP Test File
### Compatible with VS Code REST Client extension and IntelliJ HTTP Client
###
### How to use:
###   1. VS Code: Install "REST Client" extension → click "Send Request" above each request
###   2. Set BASE_URL and API_KEY variables below before running

@BASE_URL = https://librariai-194076277787.asia-southeast1.run.app
@API_KEY = librariai-mobile-k3y-2026
@CATEGORY_ID = REPLACE_WITH_REAL_CATEGORY_ID
@DOCUMENT_ID = REPLACE_WITH_REAL_DOCUMENT_ID

###########################################################################
# TEST 1: Health Check (No Auth Required)
###########################################################################

### T1 — Health Check
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

###########################################################################
# TEST 2: Authentication
###########################################################################

### T2a — Auth: Valid API Key via Header
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/categories
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T2b — Auth: Valid API Key via Query Param
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/categories?apiKey={{API_KEY}}
Accept: application/json

###

### T2c — Auth: Missing API Key → Expect 401
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/categories
Accept: application/json

###

### T2d — Auth: Wrong API Key → Expect 401
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/categories
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: wrong-invalid-key-12345

###########################################################################
# TEST 3: Categories
###########################################################################

### T3a — List All Categories (default pagination)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/categories
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T3b — List Categories with Pagination
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/categories?page=1&limit=5
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T3c — List Categories with Search Filter
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/categories?search=skripsi
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T3d — Get Category Detail
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/categories/{{CATEGORY_ID}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T3e — Get Category Detail: Not Found → Expect 404
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/categories/id-yang-tidak-ada-sama-sekali
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###########################################################################
# TEST 4: Documents
###########################################################################

### T4a — List All Documents
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/documents
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T4b — List Documents by Category
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/documents?categoryId={{CATEGORY_ID}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T4c — List Documents with Status Filter (ready)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/documents?status=ready&limit=5
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T4d — List Documents with Status Filter (processing)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/documents?status=processing
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T4e — List Documents: Invalid Status → Expect 400
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/documents?status=unknown
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T4f — Get Document Detail
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/documents/{{DOCUMENT_ID}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T4g — Get Document Detail: Not Found → Expect 404
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/documents/id-dokumen-tidak-ada
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###########################################################################
# TEST 5: Semantic Search
###########################################################################

### T5a — Semantic Search (basic)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/search?q=metode+penelitian+kualitatif&categoryId={{CATEGORY_ID}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T5b — Semantic Search with topK
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/search?q=kesimpulan+dan+saran&categoryId={{CATEGORY_ID}}&topK=3
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T5c — Semantic Search: Missing q → Expect 400
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/search?categoryId={{CATEGORY_ID}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T5d — Semantic Search: Missing categoryId → Expect 400
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/search?q=metode+penelitian
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T5e — Semantic Search: Category Not Found → Expect 404
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/search?q=test&categoryId=kategori-tidak-ada
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###########################################################################
# TEST 6: AI Chat
###########################################################################

### T6a — AI Chat: First Message (no history)
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/chat?message=Apa+isi+utama+dari+dokumen+dalam+koleksi+ini%3F&categoryId={{CATEGORY_ID}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T6b — AI Chat: Multi-turn (paste historyForNextRequest from T6a response)
# Replace HISTORY_BASE64 with value of data.historyForNextRequest from previous response
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/chat?message=Bisa+jelaskan+lebih+detail%3F&categoryId={{CATEGORY_ID}}&history=HISTORY_BASE64
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T6c — AI Chat: Missing message → Expect 400
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/chat?categoryId={{CATEGORY_ID}}
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T6d — AI Chat: Missing categoryId → Expect 400
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/chat?message=Apa+ini%3F
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T6e — AI Chat: Category Not Found → Expect 404
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/chat?message=test&categoryId=kategori-tidak-ada
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}

###

### T6f — AI Chat: Invalid history base64 → Expect 400
GET {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/chat?message=test&categoryId={{CATEGORY_ID}}&history=INVALID!!!BASE64
Accept: application/json
X-API-Key: {{API_KEY}}
